# Agent skill packages installed into the project (e.g. `npx skills add ...`).
# Kept locally but out of the repository: one install added 4,064 files and
# 47MB of GPU-computing toolkits unrelated to this product, and skills run
# with full agent permissions, so vendoring them silently is a supply-chain
# risk as much as a size one.
.claude/skills/
